Original-source floating frontier audit, 2026-09-15

Pinned GCC torture source: 78d4ac73dd391005b895a6148cd9831e28e1208b.
Unchanged gcc/testsuite/gcc.c-torture/execute sources; no reduction replaces an original.
Fixed linux/arm64 evo-flight-lab:sealed, network none, GCC 14.2 / Clang 19.1.7.
Each source: CC -std=gnu11 <original applied options> -O0/-O2 SOURCE -lm -o probe;
run the built executable with timeout 10. The original applied option is
-std=gnu89 for 921013-1, 921124-1, 930106-1, 930513-1 and 930603-1;
the other applied-option lists are empty. Written options follow -std=gnu11.
Zero exits are oracle results, not EvoCC PASS. FP dispositions below are based
on the named source operation, never on the E3101 code alone. Storage-only
constant assignments have their own positive regression and are not waived.

